WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:29.871
Tom looked in the Royal Ballroom.

2
00:00:29.872 --> 00:00:36.618
Streamers hung from the ceiling.

3
00:00:36.619 --> 00:00:42.290
Servants were putting flowers on the tables.

4
00:00:42.291 --> 00:00:46.222
"What's going on?" Tom asked.

5
00:00:46.223 --> 00:00:50.856
Cat peeked out of Tom's pocket.

6
00:00:50.857 --> 00:00:54.485
"There's a birthday party tomorrow," she said.

7
00:00:54.486 --> 00:00:59.032
"I heard Cook talking about it."

8
00:00:59.033 --> 00:01:02.474
"Whose birthday is it?" Tom asked.

9
00:01:02.475 --> 00:01:06.099
"Prince Eric's," Cat said.

10
00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:09.322
Just then Dirk appeared.

11
00:01:09.323 --> 00:01:13.922
"There you are, fool!" he snapped at Tom.

12
00:01:13.923 --> 00:01:18.585
"The queen wants to see you at once.

13
00:01:18.586 --> 00:01:23.698
Come with me!"

14
00:01:23.699 --> 00:01:30.667
Tom hurried after Dirk to the Throne Room.

15
00:01:30.668 --> 00:01:33.683
Cat was still in his pocket.

16
00:01:33.684 --> 00:01:36.708
"Uh-oh," Tom thought.

17
00:01:36.709 --> 00:01:40.656
"Cat might make the queen sneeze."

18
00:01:40.657 --> 00:01:43.857
The queen sat on her throne.

19
00:01:43.858 --> 00:01:50.015
Tom bowed. "Good morning, Your Majesty."

20
00:01:50.016 --> 00:01:52.434
The queen's nose wriggled.

21
00:01:52.435 --> 00:02:01.685
She pulled out her handkerchief.

22
00:02:01.686 --> 00:02:08.372
"Ah-choo!" The queen sneezed.

23
00:02:08.373 --> 00:02:12.832
"Tom, I need your help again," she said.

24
00:02:12.833 --> 00:02:16.881
"Anything, Your Majesty," Tom said.

25
00:02:16.882 --> 00:02:21.260
The queen blew her nose.

26
00:02:21.261 --> 00:02:25.340
"Prince Eric's birthday is tomorrow," she said.

27
00:02:25.341 --> 00:02:29.465
"And I need a special gift for him."

28
00:02:29.466 --> 00:02:35.714
"What does Prince Eric want?" Tom asked.

29
00:02:35.715 --> 00:02:40.101
"Prince Eric loves animals," the queen said.

30
00:02:40.102 --> 00:02:42.733
"He wants a pet.

31
00:02:42.734 --> 00:02:46.817
I want to get him a dog."

32
00:02:46.818 --> 00:02:49.992
"A dog?" Tom repeated.

33
00:02:49.993 --> 00:02:54.887
Hiss! A loud sound came from Tom's pocket.

34
00:02:54.888 --> 00:03:02.829
Then he felt something sharp—Cat's claws!
